petrus-motus-zeromq
Copyright 2026 Seasoned

This package is a Haskell port of Petrus Motus's ZeroMQ Dispatch transport
(petrus.motus.transport.zeromq, protocol v2) from Petrus
(https://github.com/henriquebastos/petrus), pinned under upstream/petrus
(see UPSTREAM.md at the repository root). It reproduces the observable
behaviour of that reference, and its test suite ports the reference's tests
and runs differential checks against it.

It binds libzmq (Copyright The ZeroMQ authors, Mozilla Public License 2.0,
https://zeromq.org) through the system library; libzmq is not part of this
package.

